],"requires_context":false,"choices":[],"classes":[{"value":1,"label":"（ ）内の犯罪が既遂になる場合"},{"value":2,"label":"未遂にとどまる場合"},{"value":3,"label":"既遂にも未遂にもならない場合"}],"answer_slots":[{"no":10,"official_answer":1,"statement_label":"ア"},{"no":11,"official_answer":2,"statement_label":"イ"},{"no":12,"official_answer":1,"statement_label":"ウ"},{"no":13,"official_answer":3,"statement_label":"エ"},{"no":14,"official_answer":1,"statement_label":"オ"}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":{"correct_needed":4,"points":2},"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":"４問正解で部分点２点"},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":["yobi-2017-keiho-q09-a","yobi-2017-keiho-q09-b","yobi-2017-keiho-q09-c","yobi-2017-keiho-q09-d","yobi-2017-keiho-q09-e"],"statement_truth_derivable":false,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/H29-2017/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/H29-2017/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":6,"line_range":[199,223],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q10","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2017,"era":"H29"},"subject":"keiho","number":10,"points":2,"format":"single_choice","polarity":"correct","exhaustive":false,"unordered":false,"stem":"名誉毀損罪に関する次の１から５までの各記述を判例の立場に従って検討した場合，正しいものはどれか。（解答欄は，[№15］）","context":[],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":false,"choices":[],"answer_slots":[{"no":15,"official_answer":4}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":""},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":["yobi-2017-keiho-q10-1","yobi-2017-keiho-q10-2","yobi-2017-keiho-q10-3","yobi-2017-keiho-q10-4","yobi-2017-keiho-q10-5"],"statement_truth_derivable":true,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/H29-2017/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/H29-2017/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":6,"line_range":[224,241],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q11","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2017,"era":"H29"},"subject":"keiho","number":11,"points":2,"format":"fill_blank","polarity":null,"exhaustive":false,"unordered":false,"stem":"学生Ａ，Ｂ及びＣは，次の【事例】における甲の罪責について，後記【会話】のとおり検討している。【会話】中の①から⑤までの（ ）内から適切な語句を選んだ場合，正しいものの組合せは，後記１から５までのうちどれか。（解答欄は，[№16］）","context":[{"kind":"事例","text":"甲は，乙がＶに対して暴行を加えていたところに通り掛かり，乙との間で共謀を遂げた上，乙と一緒にＶに対して暴行を加えた。Ｖは，甲の共謀加担前後にわたる一連の暴行を加えられた際に１個の傷害を負ったが，Ｖの傷害が，甲の共謀加担前の乙の暴行により生じたのか，甲の共謀加担後の甲又は乙の暴行により生じたのかは，証拠上不明であった。"},{"kind":"会話","text":"学生Ａ．私は，共犯は自己の行為と因果関係を有する結果についてのみ責任を負うという見解に立ち，後行者は，共謀加担前の先行者の暴行により生じた傷害結果には因果性を及ぼし得ないと考えます。事例の場合，甲には①（ａ．暴行罪・ｂ．傷害罪）の共同正犯が成立すると考えます。事例とは異なり，Ｖの傷害が甲の共謀加担後の甲又は乙の暴行により生じたことが証拠上明らかな場合，甲には傷害罪の共同正犯が②（ｃ．成立する・ｄ．成立しない）と考えます。\n学生Ｂ．Ａ君の見解に対しては，甲に対する傷害罪の成立範囲が③（ｅ．狭く・ｆ．広く）なり過ぎるとの批判が可能ですね。\n学生Ｃ．私は，事例の場合には，同時傷害の特例としての刑法第２０７条が適用され，甲は，Ｖの傷害結果について責任を負うと考えます。その理由の一つとして，仮に甲が乙と意思の連絡なく，Ｖに暴行を加えた場合に比べ，事例における甲が④（ｇ．不利・ｈ．有利）に扱われることになるのは不均衡であると考えられることが挙げられます。\n学生Ｂ．乙には，甲の共謀加担前後にわたる一連の暴行の際にＶに生じた傷害結果についての傷害罪が成立するのであり，傷害結果について責任を負う者が誰もいなくなるわけではないということは，Ｃ君の⑤（ｉ．見解に対する批判・ｊ．見解の根拠）となり得ますね。"}],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":true,"choices":[{"number":1,"text":"①ａ ②ｃ ③ｅ ④ｈ ⑤ｉ","blanks":[{"blank":1,"word":"ａ"},{"blank":2,"word":"ｃ"},{"blank":3,"word":"ｅ"},{"blank":4,"word":"ｈ"},{"blank":5,"word":"ｉ"}]},{"number":2,"text":"①ｂ ②ｄ ③ｆ ④ｇ ⑤ｊ","blanks":[{"blank":1,"word":"ｂ"},{"blank":2,"word":"ｄ"},{"blank":3,"word":"ｆ"},{"blank":4,"word":"ｇ"},{"blank":5,"word":"ｊ"}]},{"number":3,"text":"①ａ ②ｃ ③ｆ ④ｇ ⑤ｊ","blanks":[{"blank":1,"word":"ａ"},{"blank":2,"word":"ｃ"},{"blank":3,"word":"ｆ"},{"blank":4,"word":"ｇ"},{"blank":5,"word":"ｊ"}]},{"number":4,"text":"①ｂ ②ｃ ③ｅ ④ｈ ⑤ｉ","blanks":[{"blank":1,"word":"ｂ"},{"blank":2,"word":"ｃ"},{"blank":3,"word":"ｅ"},{"blank":4,"word":"ｈ"},{"blank":5,"word":"ｉ"}]},{"number":5,"text":"①ａ ②ｃ ③ｅ ④ｇ ⑤ｊ","blanks":[{"blank":1,"word":"ａ"},{"blank":2,"word":"ｃ"},{"blank":3,"word":"ｅ"},{"blank":4,"word":"ｇ"},{"blank":5,"word":"ｊ"}]}],"answer_slots":[{"no":16,"official_answer":1}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":""},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":[],"statement_truth_derivable":false,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/H29-2017/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/H29-2017/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":7,"line_range":[243,274],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q12","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2017,"era":"H29"},"subject":"keiho","number":12,"points":2,"format":"combination","polarity":"correct","exhaustive":false,"unordered":false,"stem":"犯人蔵匿及び証拠隠滅の罪に関する次のアからオまでの各記述を判例の立場に従って検討した場合，正しいものの組合せは，後記１から５までのうちどれか。（解答欄は，[№17］）","context":[],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":false,"choices":[{"number":1,"text":"ア ウ","labels":["ア","ウ"]},{"number":2,"text":"ア エ","labels":["ア","エ"]},{"number":3,"text":"イ エ","labels":["イ","エ"]},{"number":4,"text":"イ オ","labels":["イ","オ"]},{"number":5,"text":"ウ オ","labels":["ウ","オ"]}],"answer_slots":[{"no":17,"official_answer":5}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":""},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":["yobi-2017-keiho-q12-a","yobi-2017-keiho-q12-b","yobi-2017-keiho-q12-c","yobi-2017-keiho-q12-d","yobi-2017-keiho-q12-e"],"statement_truth_derivable":true,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/H29-2017/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/H29-2017/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":7,"line_range":[275,292],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q13","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2017,"era":"H29"},"subject":"keiho","number":13,"points":3,"format":"multi_select_unordered","polarity":"correct","exhaustive":false,"unordered":true,"stem":"次の【事例】に関する後記１から５までの各【記述】を判例の立場に従って検討し，正しいものを２個選びなさい。（解答欄は，[№18］，[№19］順不同）","context":[{"kind":"事例","text":"甲は，覚せい剤の密売人である乙から，偽造した１万円札と引換えに覚せい剤をだまし取ろうと考え，１万円札の偽造に使用する目的で，作業部屋を自己名義で賃借した上，印刷機及び印刷用紙を購入して同部屋に運び込み，それらを使用して１万円札１００枚を偽造した。（①）\nその後，甲は，ホテルの部屋で乙と会い，乙に対し，１００万円相当の覚せい剤（以下「本件覚せい剤」という。）の代金として，偽造した１万円札１００枚を渡した。乙は，甲から渡された１万円札が偽札であることに気付かずに，甲に対し，本件覚せい剤を渡し，甲は，これを持って同部屋を出た。（②）\n甲は，本件覚せい剤をホテルの駐車場に駐車中の自己の自動車内に置いたところ，甲が乙に渡した１万円札が偽札であることに気付いて追い掛けてきた乙から，本件覚せい剤を返還するように求められた。甲は，本件覚せい剤の返還を免れるため，殺意をもって乙の首を両手で絞めて乙を殺害した。（③）\nその数日後，甲は，本件覚せい剤を所持しているのを警察官に現認され，覚せい剤取締法違反の現行犯人として逮捕され，Ａ警察署に連行された。警察官丙は，Ａ警察署の取調室において，甲の弁解録取手続を行い，甲の供述内容を弁解録取書に記載した上，同弁解録取書を甲に手渡して内容の確認を求めたところ，甲は，署名押印する前に同弁解録取書を両手で破った。（④）\n甲は，同取調室から逃げ出し，Ａ警察署の敷地外に出た。（⑤）"}],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":true,"choices":[],"answer_slots":[{"no":18,"official_answer":3},{"no":19,"official_answer":4}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":true,"raw_note":"順不同（部分点なし）"},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":["yobi-2017-keiho-q13-1","yobi-2017-keiho-q13-2","yobi-2017-keiho-q13-3","yobi-2017-keiho-q13-4","yobi-2017-keiho-q13-5"],"statement_truth_derivable":true,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/H29-2017/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/H29-2017/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":8,"line_range":[294,327],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]}],"statements":[{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q01-1","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q01","label":"１","text":"甲が，Ｖの胸部，腹部及び腰部を殴打したり足蹴りしたりする暴行を加えたところ，それに耐えかねたＶは，その場から逃走した際，逃げることに必死の余り，過って路上に転倒し，縁石に頭部を打ち付けたことによって，くも膜下出血により死亡した。この場合，甲の暴行とＶの死亡との間には，因果関係がある。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":1,"official_answer":1},{"no":2,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[14,17]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q01-2","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q01","label":"２","text":"甲が，Ｖを突き倒し，その胸部を踏み付ける暴行を加え，Ｖに血胸の傷害を負わせたところ，Ｖは，Ｖの胸腔内に貯留した血液を消滅させるため医師が投与した薬剤の影響により，かねてＶが罹患していた結核性の病巣が変化して炎症を起こし，同炎症に基づく心機能不全により死亡した。この場合，甲の暴行とＶの死亡との間には，因果関係がない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":1,"official_answer":1},{"no":2,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[18,21]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q01-3","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q01","label":"３","text":"甲は，自動車を運転中，過って同車をＶに衝突させてＶを同車の屋根に跳ね上げ，その意識を喪失させたが，Ｖに気付かないまま同車の運転を続けるうち，同車の助手席に同乗していた乙がＶに気付き，走行中の同車の屋根からＶを引きずり降ろして路上に転落させた。Ｖは，頭部打撲傷に基づくくも膜下出血により死亡したところ，同傷害は，自動車と衝突した際に生じたものか，路上に転落した際に生じたものかは不明であった。この場合，甲の衝突行為とＶの死亡との間には，因果関係がある。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":1,"official_answer":1},{"no":2,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[22,27]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q01-4","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q01","label":"４","text":"甲は，狩猟仲間のＶを熊と誤認して猟銃弾を１発発射し，Ｖの大腿部に命中させて大量出血を伴う重傷を負わせた直後，自らの誤射に気付き，苦悶するＶを殺害して逃走しようと決意し，更に至近距離からＶを目掛けて猟銃弾を１発発射し，Ｖの胸部に命中させてＶを失血により即死させた。Ｖの大腿部の銃創は放置すると十数分で死亡する程度のものである一方，胸部の銃創はそれ単独で放置すると半日から１日で死亡する程度のものであった。この場合，甲の２発目の発射行為とＶの死亡との間には，因果関係がない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":1,"official_answer":1},{"no":2,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[28,33]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q01-5","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q01","label":"５","text":"甲は，Ｖの頭部を多数回殴打する暴行を加えた結果，Ｖに脳出血を発生させて意識喪失状態に陥らせた上，Ｖを放置して立ち去った。その後，Ｖは，甲とは無関係な乙から角材で頭頂部を殴打される暴行を加えられ，死亡するに至った。Ｖの死因は甲の暴行により形成された脳出血であり，乙の暴行は，既に発生していた脳出血を拡大させ，幾分か死期を早める影響を与えるものであった。この場合，甲の暴行とＶの死亡との間には，因果関係がある。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":1,"official_answer":1},{"no":2,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[34,38]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q02-a","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q02","label":"ア","text":"営利の目的で未成年者を買い受けた場合，未成年者買受け罪のみが成立する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":3,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[44,44]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q02-a","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":2,"label":"ア"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q02-b","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q02","label":"イ","text":"身の代金目的誘拐罪は，近親者その他誘拐された者の安否を憂慮する者の憂慮に乗じてその財物を交付させる目的を主観的要素とする目的犯である。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"combination","basis":"convention","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":3,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[45,46]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q02-b","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":2,"label":"イ"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q02-c","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q02","label":"ウ","text":"身の代金目的で成年者を略取し，公訴が提起される前に同成年者を安全な場所に解放すれば，身の代金目的略取罪の刑が必要的に減軽される。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"combination","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":3,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[47,48]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q02-c","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":2,"label":"ウ"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q02-d","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q02","label":"エ","text":"未成年者誘拐罪は親告罪である。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"combination","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":3,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[49,49]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q02-d","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":2,"label":"エ"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q02-e","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q02","label":"オ","text":"親権者は，未成年者誘拐罪の主体とはならない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":3,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[50,50]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q02-e","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":2,"label":"オ"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q04-a","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q04","label":"ア","text":"インターネットを介した書籍販売業を営む甲は，日本語で書かれたわいせつな文書である小説を，その購入を申し込んできた日本国内在住の多数の外国人に販売したところ，いずれの外国人も日本語の読解能力に乏しく，同小説の内容を理解できなかった。（わいせつ物頒布罪）","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[81,84]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q04-b","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q04","label":"イ","text":"甲は，インターネットを介して多数の希望者を募った上，その希望者らに無料で交付する目的で，わいせつな映像を記録したＤＶＤを所持した。（わいせつ物有償頒布目的所持罪）","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[85,86]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q04-c","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q04","label":"ウ","text":"甲は，わいせつな映像を記録したＤＶＤの販売業者に対してそのＤＶＤの購入を申し込み，これを購入した。（わいせつ物頒布罪の教唆犯）","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[87,88]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q04-d","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q04","label":"エ","text":"ＤＶＤのレンタル業を営む甲は，わいせつな映像を記録したＤＶＤを，多数の顧客へ有償で貸し出した。（わいせつ物頒布罪）","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[89,90]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q04-e","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q04","label":"オ","text":"甲がインターネットを介したわいせつな映像の販売業を営み始めたところ，その購入を申し込んできた顧客は１名だけであったが，甲は，その者に対して，電子メールに同映像のデータを添付して送信した。（わいせつ物頒布罪）","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[91,93]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q05-a","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q05","label":"ア","text":"甲及び乙には，強度の弱いＢ鋼材で補強工事を行うことの意思連絡はあるが，不注意の共同はあり得ないから，甲及び乙に業務上過失致死罪の共同正犯が成立する余地はない。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":6,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[114,115]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q05-b","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q05","label":"イ","text":"丙は，甲及び乙が強度の弱いＢ鋼材で補強工事を行っていることを認識していたが，工期が迫っていたことから，これを黙認したという場合，直接行為者である甲及び乙に過失が認められたとしても，更に丙に過失が認められる余地がある。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"combination","basis":"exhaustive","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":6,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[116,118]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q05-c","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q05","label":"ウ","text":"仮に，甲及び乙において，Ｖ１が死亡するに至る実際の因果経過を具体的に予見することが不可能であった場合，甲及び乙には業務上過失致死罪は成立しない。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":6,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[119,120]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q05-d","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q05","label":"エ","text":"仮に，Ｖ１運転のトラックの荷台に，Ｖ１に無断でＶ２が乗り込んでおり，同トラックがＸ川に転落したことによって，Ｖ１及びＶ２の両名が死亡した場合，甲及び乙にはＶ２に対する業務上過失致死罪は成立しない。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":6,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[121,123]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q06-1","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q06","label":"１","text":"「自説のように解さないと処罰範囲が広くなり過ぎる」ことは，Ｂ説の根拠となり得る。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":7,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[134,134]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q06-2","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q06","label":"２","text":"「刑法第２１９条（遺棄等致死傷罪）が致傷罪という加重処罰規定を置いている」ことは，Ａ説の根拠となり得る。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":7,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[135,136]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q06-3","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q06","label":"３","text":"「刑法第２１８条（保護責任者遺棄罪）が生存に必要な保護をしなかったことを遺棄とともに処罰の対象としている」ことは，Ｂ説の根拠となり得る。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":7,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[137,138]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q06-4","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q06","label":"４","text":"「遺棄罪の懲役刑の上限が傷害罪の懲役刑の上限よりも軽い」ことは，Ｂ説の根拠となり得る。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":7,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[139,140]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q06-5","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q06","label":"５","text":"「刑法典は，殺人，傷害，過失傷害，堕胎の各罪の章の後に遺棄の罪の章を置いている」ことは，Ａ説の根拠となり得る。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":7,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[141,142]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q07-1","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q07","label":"１","text":"甲が乙に対し，深夜の公園で待ち伏せしてＡから金品を喝取するように教唆したところ，乙は，その旨決意し，深夜の公園でＡを待ち伏せしたが，偶然通り掛かったＢをＡと誤認してＢから金品を喝取した。乙は，人違いに気付き，引き続きＡを待ち伏せして，通り掛かったＡから金品を喝取しようとしてＡを脅迫したが，Ａに逃げられてしまい金品を喝取することができなかった。甲にはＡに対する恐喝未遂罪の教唆犯のみが成立する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":8,"official_answer":3}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[151,155]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q15-1","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":15,"label":"１"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q07-2","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q07","label":"２","text":"甲が乙に対し，Ａをナイフで脅してＡから金品を強取するように教唆したところ，乙は，その旨決意し，Ａをナイフで脅したが，その最中に殺意を抱き，Ａの腹部をナイフで刺してＡに傷害を負わせ，Ａから金品を強取したものの，Ａを殺害するには至らなかった。甲には強盗罪の教唆犯が成立するにとどまる。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":8,"official_answer":3}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[156,159]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q15-2","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":15,"label":"２"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q07-3","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q07","label":"３","text":"甲が乙に対し，留守宅であるＡ方に侵入して金品を窃取するように教唆したところ，乙は，その旨決意したが，Ｂ方をＡ方と誤認してＢ方に侵入し，その場にいたＢから金品を強取した。甲にはＢ方への住居侵入罪及びＢに対する窃盗罪の教唆犯が成立する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":8,"official_answer":3}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[160,162]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q15-3","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":15,"label":"３"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q07-4","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q07","label":"４","text":"甲が乙に対し，現住建造物であるＡ家屋に放火するように教唆したところ，乙は，その旨決意し，Ａ家屋に延焼させる目的で，Ａ家屋に隣接した現住建造物であるＢ家屋に放火したが，Ｂ家屋のみを焼損し，Ａ家屋には燃え移らなかった。甲にはＡ家屋に対する現住建造物等放火未遂罪の教唆犯のみが成立する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":8,"official_answer":3}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[163,166]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q15-4","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":15,"label":"４"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q07-5","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q07","label":"５","text":"甲は，土建業者ＡがＢ市発注予定の土木工事を請け負うためＢ市役所土木係員乙に現金を供与しようと考えていることを知り，乙に対し，Ａに工事予定価格を教える見返りとしてＡから現金を受け取り，Ａに工事予定価格を教えるように教唆したところ，乙は，その旨決意し，Ａとの間で，Ａに工事予定価格を教える旨約束して，Ａから現金１００万円を受け取ったが，その後，工事予定価格を教えなかった。甲には加重収賄罪の教唆犯が成立する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":8,"official_answer":3}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[167,171]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q15-5","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":15,"label":"５"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q08-1","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q08","label":"１","text":"甲は，住宅街の駐車場に駐車中の乙所有の自動車を燃やそうと考え，自己の自動車に灯油を積みライターを持って同自動車を運転して同駐車場に向かったところ，その途中，交通事故を起こし，乙所有の自動車に放火することができなかった。この場合，甲には，建造物等以外放火罪の予備罪が成立する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":9,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[177,180]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q08-2","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q08","label":"２","text":"甲は，乙が居住する乙所有の家屋を燃やそうと考え，同家屋に放火し全焼させたところ，同家屋内で就寝中の乙が焼死した。甲が乙を殺そうと考えて同家屋に放火した場合でも，甲には，法定刑に死刑を含む現住建造物等放火罪のみが成立する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":9,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[181,183]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q08-3","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q08","label":"３","text":"甲は，山奥で乙を殺害した後，乙の失踪を装うため，乙が一人で居住していた丙所有の家屋を燃やそうと考え，同家屋に放火し全焼させた。同家屋に人がいなかった場合でも，甲には，現住建造物等放火罪が成立する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":9,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[184,186]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q08-4","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q08","label":"４","text":"甲は，不要となった甲所有の自動車を燃やそうと考え，同自動車に放火し全焼させ，公共の危険を生じさせた。甲に公共の危険が生じることについての認識がなかった場合でも，甲には，建造物等以外放火罪が成立する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":9,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[187,189]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q08-5","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q08","label":"５","text":"甲は，乙が居住する乙所有の家屋を燃やそうと考え，同家屋の壁際に駐車されていた乙所有の自動車に放火して焼損し，同家屋への延焼の危険を生じさせたが，その火は通行人により消し止められ，同家屋に燃え移らなかった。この場合，甲には，建造物等以外放火罪のみが成立する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":9,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[190,193]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q09-a","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q09","label":"ア","text":"甲は，会社事務所内において現金を窃取して，戸外に出たところを警備員乙に発見されて取り押さえられそうになったため，逮捕を免れようと考え，乙に対し，刃体の長さ２０センチメートルの出刃包丁をその腹部に突き付け，「ぶっ殺すぞ。」と怒鳴り付けたが，偶然その場を通り掛かった警察官に取り押さえられ，逮捕を免れることができなかった。（事後強盗罪）","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[203,206]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q09-b","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q09","label":"イ","text":"甲は，行使の目的で，カラープリンターを用いて，複写用紙に真正な千円札の表面及び裏面を複写して千円札を偽造しようとしたが，カラープリンターの操作を誤ったため，完成したものは，一般人がこれを一見した場合に真正な千円札と誤認する程度の外観を備えたものではなかった。（通貨偽造罪）","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[207,210]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q09-c","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q09","label":"ウ","text":"甲は，通行中の乙に因縁を付けて乙から現金を脅し取ろうと考え，乙に対し，「俺をにらんできただろ。金を払えば許してやる。金を出せ。」などと大声で怒鳴り付けて反抗を抑圧するに至らない程度の脅迫を加え，同脅迫により畏怖した乙は，甲に現金を直接手渡さなかったものの，甲が乙のズボンのポケットから乙が所有する現金在中の財布を抜き取って持ち去るのを黙認した。（恐喝罪）","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[211,215]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q09-d","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q09","label":"エ","text":"甲は，知り合いの女性乙を自己が運転する自動車に乗せて同車内において強いて姦淫しようと考え，乙に対し，「自宅まで送ってあげる。」とうそを言ったところ，乙は，これを信じて同車に乗り込んだが，甲の態度を不審に思い即座に同車から降りた。（強姦罪）","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[216,218]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q09-e","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q09","label":"オ","text":"甲は，会社事務所にある現金を窃取する目的で，門塀に囲まれ，警備員が配置されて出入りが制限されている同事務所の敷地内に塀を乗り越えて立ち入ったが，同事務所の建物に立ち入る前に警備員に発見され敷地外に逃走した。（建造物侵入罪）","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":null,"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[219,221]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q10-1","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q10","label":"１","text":"摘示される「事実」は，非公知のものでなければならないから，公知の事実を摘示した場合には，名誉毀損罪は成立しない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":15,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[227,228]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q18-1","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":18,"label":"１"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q10-2","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q10","label":"２","text":"事実の摘示が「公然」といえるためには，摘示内容を不特定かつ多数人が認識し得る状態にあったことが必要であるから，不特定ではあるが，少数人しか認識し得ない状態にとどまる場合には，名誉毀損罪は成立しない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":15,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[229,231]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q18-2","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":18,"label":"２"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q10-3","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q10","label":"３","text":"名誉の主体である「人」は，自然人に限られるから，法人の名誉を毀損した場合には，名誉毀損罪は成立しない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":15,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[232,233]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q18-3","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":18,"label":"３"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q10-4","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q10","label":"４","text":"死者の名誉を毀損したとしても，虚偽の事実を摘示した場合でなければ処罰されないから，摘示した事実が真実である場合には，名誉毀損罪として処罰されない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":15,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[234,235]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q18-4","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":18,"label":"４"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q10-5","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q10","label":"５","text":"人の名誉を侵害するに足りる事実を公然と摘示したとしても，現実に人の名誉が侵害されていない場合には，名誉毀損罪は成立しない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"single_choice","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":15,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[236,237]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q18-5","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":18,"label":"５"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q12-a","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q12","label":"ア","text":"犯人の親族が当該犯人の利益のために犯人蔵匿罪を犯したときは，当該親族に対する刑は減軽しなければならない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":17,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[278,279]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q14-a","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":14,"label":"ア"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q12-b","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q12","label":"イ","text":"犯人隠避罪の「罰金以上の刑に当たる罪を犯した者」には，犯人として既に逮捕・勾留されている者は含まれない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":17,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[280,281]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q14-b","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":14,"label":"イ"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q12-c","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q12","label":"ウ","text":"証拠隠滅罪の「他人の刑事事件」は，犯人蔵匿罪と異なり，罰金以上の刑に当たる罪に限られない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"combination","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":17,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[282,283]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q14-c","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":14,"label":"ウ"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q12-d","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q12","label":"エ","text":"証人等威迫罪の「威迫」は，相手と面会して直接なされる場合に限られ，文書を送付して相手にその内容を了知させる方法によりなされる場合を含まない。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"convention","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":17,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[284,285]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q14-d","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":14,"label":"エ"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q12-e","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q12","label":"オ","text":"犯人が自己の刑事事件の裁判に必要な知識を有する証人を威迫した場合，証人等威迫罪が成立する。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"combination","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":17,"official_answer":5}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[286,287]},"same_as":[{"id":"shiho-2017-keiho-q14-e","exam":"司法","era":"H29","year":2017,"number":14,"label":"オ"}]},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q13-1","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q13","label":"１","text":"①について，甲が作業部屋を自己名義で賃借した行為は，通貨偽造罪の予備行為に該当することから，その段階で甲には通貨偽造等準備罪が成立する。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":18,"official_answer":3},{"no":19,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[315,316]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q13-2","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q13","label":"２","text":"②について，甲には詐欺罪が成立し，偽造通貨行使罪は詐欺罪に吸収される。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":18,"official_answer":3},{"no":19,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[317,317]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q13-3","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q13","label":"３","text":"③について，覚せい剤は，法定の除外事由なく所持することが禁じられた物であるが，甲は，本件覚せい剤の返還を免れるために乙を殺害していることから，甲には強盗殺人罪が成立する。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":18,"official_answer":3},{"no":19,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[318,319]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q13-4","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q13","label":"４","text":"④について，丙が作成した弁解録取書には，甲の署名押印がないが，甲の供述内容が記載されていることから，甲には公用文書等毀棄罪が成立する。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":18,"official_answer":3},{"no":19,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[320,321]}},{"id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q13-5","question_id":"yobi-2017-keiho-q13","label":"５","text":"⑤について，甲は，逮捕中に逃走し，Ａ警察署の敷地外に出ていることから，甲には単純逃走罪が成立する。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"multi_select_unordered","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":18,"official_answer":3},{"no":19,"official_answer":4}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[322,323]}}],"explanations":[]}